                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15a3/773a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-03-22T13:00:00-05:00">March 22, 1930—1
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>244. To press for three-power agreement is the only thing we can see to do.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
